# Plan quality checklist: <Project>
<!-- Write to docs/checklists/plan-quality.md only during an authorized checklist operation.
Check a box only with evidence from the plan and source spec. Analysis never checks boxes. -->

- [ ] The plan traces every declared requirement from `docs/spec.md`, or records the approved tiny-project source.
  Evidence: <requirement IDs and docs/plan.md:lines>
- [ ] In-scope and out-of-scope outcomes are explicit.
  Evidence: <docs/plan.md:lines>
- [ ] Every planned story maps to stable requirement IDs and declares dependencies and parallel safety.
  Evidence: <story rows and docs/plan.md:lines>
- [ ] Test, lint, build and run commands are exact, or each inapplicable command is justified as `N/A`.
  Evidence: <commands, docs/plan.md:lines and N/A judgment>
- [ ] Architecture decisions give reasons and every risk has a mitigation.
  Evidence: <docs/plan.md:lines>
- [ ] Project constitution constraints are addressed when `docs/constitution.md` exists.
  Evidence: <rule-to-plan locations and reviewer judgment>
- [ ] No unresolved clarification remains and sign-off reflects explicit human approval only.
  Evidence: <docs/plan.md:lines and docs/approval.json status>
